#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:25
msgid ""
"To integrate Huawei Cloud with |morpheus|, we'll gather the following pieces"
" of information:"
msgstr ""
"To integrate Huawei Cloud con |morpheus|, we'll gather el following pieces "
"of información:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:27
msgid "Account Name"
msgstr "Account Name"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:28
msgid "Identity (IAM) API URL"
msgstr "Identity (IAM) API URL"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:29
msgid "Project"
msgstr "Project"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:30
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Username"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:31
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Password"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:33
msgid ""
"Begin by logging into your `Huawei Cloud console <https://console-"
"intl.huaweicloud.com/console>`_. If you're not currently logged in, you will"
" be prompted to do so. Once on the console page, hover over your username in"
" the upper-right corner of the application window and select \"My "
"Credentials\"."
msgstr ""
"Begin by logging en your `Huawei Cloud console <https://console-"
"intl.huaweicloud.com/console>`_. If you're no actualmente logged in, you "
"será be prompted to do so. Once on el console página, hover over your nombre"
" de usuario in el upper-right corner of el application ventana y select \"My"
" Credentials\"."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:36
msgid ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/1credentials.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/1credentials.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:37
msgid ""
"From the credentials page, we can gather the Account Name and the Project "
"Name, record them for later when we provide the integration information to "
"|morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"Desde el credentials página, we puede gather el Account Name y el Project "
"Name, registro them para later cuando we provide la integración información "
"to |morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:40
msgid ""
".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/2account_project.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/2account_project.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:41
msgid ""
"To gather the API endpoint URL, take a look at the complete list of "
"`endpoints <https://developer.huaweicloud.com/en-us/endpoint>`_. If a "
"specific endpoint exists for your region, use it. In any other case use the "
"endpoint for all regions. It will be formatted like this: "
"https://iam.myhuaweicloud.com/v3."
msgstr ""
"To gather el API endpoint URL, take un look at el completo lista of "
"`endpoints <https://developer.huaweicloud.com/en-us/endpoint>`_. If un "
"específico endpoint exists para your region, use it. In cualquier otro case "
"use el endpoint para todos regions. It será be formatted like este: "
"https://iam.myhuaweicloud.com/v3."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:44
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/3identity_api_endpoints.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/3identity_api_endpoints.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:45
msgid ""
"With this information gathered, and presuming you know the credentials for "
"the service account you wish to use, we can move back into |morpheus|-UI."
msgstr ""
"With este información gathered, y presuming you know el credentials para el "
"servicio cuenta you wish to use, we puede move back en |morpheus|-UI."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:47
msgid ""
"Integrating |morpheus| with Huawei Cloud requires a service account that has"
" programmatic access."
msgstr ""
"Integrating |morpheus| con Huawei Cloud requires un servicio cuenta que "
"tiene programmatic acceso."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:49
msgid ""
"Navigate to Infrastructure > Clouds and click :guilabel:`+ ADD`. Scroll to "
"Huawei Cloud and click :guilabel:`NEXT`. The information we've gathered will"
" be plugged into the CREATE CLOUD modal. The DOMAIN ID field will accept the"
" Account Name field we gathered. Your completed CREATE CLOUD modal will look"
" similar to the one pictured below:"
msgstr ""
"Navegue un Infrastructure > Clouds y click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`. Scroll to "
"Huawei Cloud y click :guilabel:`SIGUIENTE`. The información we've gathered "
"será be plugged en el CREATE CLOUD modal. The DOMAIN ID campo será accept el"
" Account Name campo we gathered. Your completed CREATE CLOUD modal será look"
" similar to el one pictured a continuación:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:52
msgid ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/4add_cloud.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/4add_cloud.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:53
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`NEXT`, add this new Cloud to a Group or create a "
"new Group. On finalizing the wizard, Huawei Cloud will be integrated into "
"|morpheus| and ready for provisioning. If you opted to inventory existing "
"workloads, those will be onboarded shortly."
msgstr ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`SIGUIENTE`, add este nuevo Cloud to un Group o "
"create un nuevo Group. On finalizing el wizard, Huawei Cloud será be "
"integrated en |morpheus| y ready para provisioning. If you opted to "
"inventory existente workloads, esos será be onboarded shortly."

