#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:86
msgid "Huawei Scalable File Service (SFS)"
msgstr "Huawei Scalable File Service (SFS)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:88
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| integration with Huawei Cloud includes the capability to work"
" with Huawei Scalable File Service (SFS). SFS is shared file storage hosted "
"on Huawei Cloud. By integrating |morpheus| with Huawei Cloud you can "
"discover, create, manage, and delete SFS servers, as well as view and work "
"with the file shares and files contained therein."
msgstr ""
"The |morpheus| integration con Huawei Cloud includes el capability to work "
"con Huawei Scalable File Service (SFS). SFS es shared archivo storage hosted"
" on Huawei Cloud. By integrating |morpheus| con Huawei Cloud you puede "
"discover, create, manage, y delete SFS servers, así como view y work con el "
"archivo shares y archivos contained therein."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:91
msgid "SFS Server Discovery and Management"
msgstr "SFS Server Discovery y Management"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:93
msgid ""
"On integrating Huawei Cloud with |morpheus|, SFS servers and file shares are"
" discovered automatically after a short time. The server(s) can be viewed in"
" Infrastructure > Storage > Servers. By viewing the server detail page and "
"clicking :guilabel:`EDIT`, the storage server can be scoped as needed. "
"Administrators can choose to scope to other Huawei Cloud integrations (if "
"more than one relevant integration currently exists), select from synced "
"availability zones, and scope the storage server to specific Tenants if "
"desired."
msgstr ""
"On integrating Huawei Cloud con |morpheus|, SFS servers y archivo shares son"
" discovered automáticamente después de un short time. El servidor(s) se "
"puede ver in Infrastructure > Storage > Servers. By viewing el servidor "
"página de detalles y clicking :guilabel:`EDITAR`, el storage server puede be"
" scoped según sea necesario. Administrators puede choose to scope to otro "
"Huawei Cloud integrations (if más than one relevante integration actualmente"
" exists), select desde synced availability zones, y scope el storage server "
"to específico Tenants si se desea."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:96
msgid ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/sfs/1editServer.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/sfs/1editServer.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:97
msgid ""
"Additionally, Huawei SFS servers can be created from the storage server list"
" page (Infrastructure > Storage > Servers) directly in |morpheus|. Click "
":guilabel:`+ ADD` to begin and set the storage server type value to \"Huawei"
" SFS\". Just like with existing synced SFS servers, those created from "
"|morpheus| can be scoped as needed."
msgstr ""
"Adicionalmente, Huawei SFS servers se puede crear desde el storage server "
"página de lista (Infrastructure > Storage > Servers) directly in |morpheus|."
" Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR` to begin y set el storage server tipo valor to "
"\"Huawei SFS\". Just like con existente synced SFS servers, esos creado "
"desde |morpheus| puede be scoped según sea necesario."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:100
msgid ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/sfs/2addServer.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/sfs/2addServer.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:102
msgid "SFS File Share Discovery and Management"
msgstr "SFS File Share Discovery y Management"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:104
msgid ""
"Discovered file shares will appear among other file shares synced with "
"|morpheus| in Infrastructure > Storage > File Shares. Depending on the "
"number of cloud integrations in your |morpheus| appliance and the number of "
"cloud integrations available to your user account, this list may be quite "
"large. Using the search bar on this page, we can narrow down the list to "
"file shares displayed to those whose names match the search terms."
msgstr ""
"Discovered archivo shares será appear among otro archivo shares synced con "
"|morpheus| in Infrastructure > Storage > File Shares. Dependiendo de el "
"número of cloud integrations in your |morpheus| appliance y el número of "
"cloud integrations disponible to your user cuenta, este lista puede be quite"
" large. Using el search bar en esta página, we puede narrow down el lista to"
" archivo shares displayed to esos whose names match el search terms."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:107
msgid ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/sfs/3shareList.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/sfs/3shareList.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:108
msgid ""
"We can drill into individual file shares by clicking on their hyperlinked "
"name in the list of all integrated file shares. From the file share detail "
"page, a list of files will appear on the files tab. Begin the process of "
"adding a new file by clicking :guilabel:`+ ADD`. The Access tab on the file "
"shares detail page allows users to view and manage ACL rules."
msgstr ""
"We puede drill en individual archivo shares by clicking on their hyperlinked"
" nombre in el lista of todos integrated archivo shares. Desde el archivo "
"share página de detalles, un lista of archivos será appear on el archivos "
"pestaña. Begin el proceso of adding un nuevo archivo by clicking "
":guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`. The Access pestaña on el archivo shares página de "
"detalles permite un los usuarios view y manage ACL rules."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:110
msgid ""
"A \"Failed to load files from storage provider\" is present when the "
"|morpheus| appliance doesn't have access to the file share."
msgstr ""
"A \"Failed to load archivos desde storage proveedor\" es present cuando el "
"|morpheus| appliance doesn't tienen acceso to el archivo share."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:112
msgid ""
"New Huawei SFS file shares can be created directly in |morpheus|. From the "
"file shares list page, get started by clicking :guilabel:`+ ADD`. Select the"
" type \"Huawei SFS Share\". Set the storage service field to a pre-existing "
"Huawei SFS server. A friendly name for the file share in |morpheus| and "
"selecting from synced availability zones are required fields."
msgstr ""
"New Huawei SFS archivo shares se puede crear directly in |morpheus|. Desde "
"el archivo shares página de lista, get started by clicking :guilabel:`+ "
"AGREGAR`. Seleccione el tipo \"Huawei SFS Share\". Establezca el storage "
"servicio campo to un pre-existente Huawei SFS server. A friendly nombre para"
" el archivo share in |morpheus| y selecting desde synced availability zones "
"son requerido campos."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:115
msgid ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/sfs/4addShare.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/sfs/4addShare.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:117
msgid "Huawei Object Storage Service (OBS)"
msgstr "Huawei Object Storage Service (OBS)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:119
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| integration with Huawei Cloud also supports Object Storage "
"Service (OBS). |morpheus| will automatically onboard existing OBS servers "
"and buckets shortly after completing the cloud integration. Before you can "
"add a new OBS server from |morpheus|, you must know or generate a key and "
"secret value from the Huawei console and must provide a Huawei OBS API "
"endpoint."
msgstr ""
"The |morpheus| integration con Huawei Cloud también supports Object Storage "
"Service (OBS). |morpheus| será automáticamente onboard existente OBS servers"
" y buckets shortly después de completing la nube integration. Before you "
"puede add un nuevo OBS server desde |morpheus|, you debe know o generate un "
"key y secret valor desde el Huawei console y debe provide un Huawei OBS API "
"endpoint."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:122
msgid "Generate a Key and Secret"
msgstr "Generate un Key y Secret"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:124
msgid ""
"From the Huawei web console, log into the account used to integrate Huawei "
"Cloud with |morpheus|. Hover over your account name in the upper-right "
"corner of the application window and click \"My Credentials\". Select "
"\"Access Keys\" from the left-hand sidebar. To create a new key, click "
":guilabel:`+ Create Access Key`. Complete the two-factor authentication "
"steps in the box that appears."
msgstr ""
"Desde el Huawei web console, log en el cuenta used to integrate Huawei Cloud"
" con |morpheus|. Hover over your cuenta nombre in el upper-right corner of "
"el application ventana y click \"My Credentials\". Select \"Access Keys\" "
"desde el left-hand sidebar. To create un nuevo key, click :guilabel:`+ "
"Create Access Key`. Complete el two-factor authentication pasos in el box "
"que appears."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:127
msgid ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/obs/1createKey.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/integration_guides/clouds/huawei/obs/1createKey.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:128
msgid ""
"Once the key is generated, download or record the key and store it in a safe"
" location. The key will not be viewable or available for download again "
"after this point."
msgstr ""
"Once el key es generated, download o registro el key y store it in un safe "
"location. The key no be viewable o disponible para download again después de"
" este point."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:131
msgid "Create OBS Server in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Create OBS Server in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:133
msgid ""
"With the key and secret value in hand from the previous section, navigate to"
" Infrastructure > Storage > Servers. Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`. On changing "
"the server type to Huawei OBS, you will see the fields for the access key "
"and the secret key. OBS API endpoints can be found in `Huawei endpoint "
"documentation <https://developer.huaweicloud.com/en-us/endpoint>`_. Include "
"those three values in the Create Server modal along with a friendly name for"
" use in |morpheus| UI. Just like with SFS objects, we can choose to scope "
"the server to all or specific Tenants at this time."
msgstr ""
"With el key y secret valor in hand desde el anterior sección, navigate to "
"Infrastructure > Storage > Servers. Click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`. On changing"
" el servidor tipo to Huawei OBS, you será see el campos para el acceso key y"
" el secret key. OBS API endpoints se puede encontrar in `Huawei endpoint "
"documentation <https://developer.huaweicloud.com/en-us/endpoint>`_. Include "
"esos three valores in el Create Server modal junto con un friendly nombre "
"para use in |morpheus| UI. Just like con SFS objetos, we puede choose to "
"scope el servidor to todos o específico Tenants en este momento."

