#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:155
msgid "Network and Router Creation"
msgstr "Network y Router Creation"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:157
msgid ""
"Once a Huawei Cloud is integrated into |morpheus|, new network creation "
"options become available. When adding a new network (Infrastructure > "
"Networks > Networks Tab), a new type labeled \"Huawei Private Network\" is "
"available when clicking :guilabel:`+ADD`. When the user creates this network"
" construct in |morpheus|, a layer two subnet is created but it's not "
"connected to a Virtual Private Cloud (VPC). This is by design as an "
"Internet-routable network is not always desired. Continue on with this "
"section after creating the network to also create a VPC (router)."
msgstr ""
"Once un Huawei Cloud es integrated en |morpheus|, nuevo network creation "
"opciones become disponible. When adding un nuevo network (Infrastructure > "
"Networks > Networks Tab), un nuevo tipo labeled \"Huawei Private Network\" "
"es disponible cuando clicking :guilabel:`+ADD`. When el usuario creates esta"
" red construct in |morpheus|, un layer two subnet es creado pero it's no "
"conectado to un Virtual Private Cloud (VPC). This es by design as un "
"Internet-routable network no es always desired. Continue on con este sección"
" después de creating la red to también create un VPC (router)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:160
msgid "Create a network"
msgstr "Create una red"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:162
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:172
msgid "Navigate to Infrastructure > Networks"
msgstr "Navegue un Infrastructure > Networks"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:163
msgid "Click on the Networks tab"
msgstr "Haga clic en el Networks pestaña"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:164
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:174
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ADD`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`+ADD`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:165
msgid "Select Huawei Private Network"
msgstr "Select Huawei Private Network"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:166
msgid "Complete the modal based on requirements for the new network"
msgstr "Complete el modal basado en requirements para el nuevo network"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:167
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:177
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`GUARDAR CHANGES`"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:170
msgid "Create a router"
msgstr "Create un router"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:173
msgid "Click on the Routers tab"
msgstr "Haga clic en el Routers pestaña"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:175
msgid "Select Huawei Router"
msgstr "Select Huawei Router"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:176
msgid "Complete the modal based on requirements for the new router"
msgstr "Complete el modal basado en requirements para el nuevo router"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/Huawei/huawei.rst:179
msgid ""
"When creating a router, it's helpful to note that the External Network is "
"the floating IP network that has been assigned to the Huawei project. This "
"network will grant your Instances their routes out to the Internet. The "
"Internal Subnet can be a layer two subnet that you may have created in the "
"previous step. In addition, multiple subnets can be added to the router "
"(VPC) and the IP address on the subnet would be the router's internal IP "
"address."
msgstr ""
"When creating un router, it's helpful to tenga en cuenta que el External "
"Network es el floating IP network que tiene sido assigned to el Huawei "
"project. This network será grant your Instances their routes out to el "
"Internet. The Internal Subnet puede be un layer two subnet que you puede "
"tienen creado in el anterior paso. Además, múltiples subnets se puede "
"agregar to el router (VPC) y el IP dirección on el subnet sería be el "
"router's interno IP dirección."
